# Rename to CODEOWNERS (in .github/, the repo root or docs/) to enable it.
# With branch protection "Require review from Code Owners", a pull request that
# touches a file needs approval from its owner. The last matching pattern wins.
# Owners are @user or @org/team. Replace the placeholders below.

# Default owner for everything
# *                       @your-org/hardware-leads

# One PCB owner at a time (KiCad PCB files do not merge)
# *.kicad_pcb             @pcb-owner

# Schematic: one owner per hierarchical sheet
# board.kicad_sch         @schematic-lead
# power.kicad_sch         @power-engineer
# mcu.kicad_sch           @firmware-hw-engineer

# Project libraries
# /lib/                   @library-owners
# *.kicad_sym             @library-owners
# *.kicad_mod             @library-owners

# CI and repository rules
# /.github/               @your-org/hardware-leads
